</strong> - A deep and full fledged single player campaign with <u><strong>Over 99 missions to complete!</strong></u> Can you unlock all the vehicles and find all the secrets?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chase</strong> - Keep your eyes open because the Cops use all tactics at their disposal to slow you down as players race to the finish!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> - Valuable items are scattered around the track as players race to collect them. The person whos collection has the highest total value wins!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunt</strong> - Perform crazy stunts to see who can get the highest score! Vehicles can rotate in the air, grind on the sides  and drift around to continue combos and increase score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gauntlet</strong> - Can you survive till the end in this challenging <strong><u>Roguelike</u></strong> mode? YOUR MISSION: Win a race on every single track in a row. After each race you gain a new random perk or bonus to help improve your chances of survival!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474450/extras/d7eaa3521d119b1b6bdc8a3697a2d325.poster.avif?t=1773866195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474450/extras/d7eaa3521d119b1b6bdc8a3697a2d325.webm?t=1773866195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474450/extras/d7eaa3521d119b1b6bdc8a3697a2d325.mp4?t=1773866195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your vehicle to suit your playstyle</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your vehicles with upgraded parts to improve your stats. Or change your rims, spoilers, paint and more to show off what you\u2019ve unlocked!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race with Friends</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players can hop on the couch and race for bragging rights across all tracks and game modes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474450/extras/243dd3d5ce0e10c63eb64c492ddf2b24.poster.avif?t=1773866195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474450/extras/243dd3d5ce0e10c63eb64c492ddf2b24.webm?t=1773866195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474450/extras/243dd3d5ce0e10c63eb64c492ddf2b24.mp4?t=1773866195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to race, tough to master</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beginners can switch on Dad mode for a fun casual experience where catching up is easier even after making making mistakes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More experienced players can use advanced techniques such as boost cancels, flawless boosts and more. These techniques along with the general gameplay allow for more skill expression then any racing game that has come before.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474450/extras/a53d6622f439f3bb5c5fde4dde8aa3dd.poster.avif?t=1773866195\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474450/extras/a53d6622f439f3bb5c5fde4dde8aa3dd.webm?t=1773866195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_